# db-sqlite: SQLite database bindings for Node.js #

For detailed information about this and other Node.js
database bindings visit the [Node.js db-sqlite homepage] [homepage].

Based on the original works by Mariano Iglesias for node-db-mysql.

## INSTALL ##

```bash
$ npm install db-sqlite
```

## QUICK START ##

```javascript
var sqlite = require('db-sqlite');
new sqlite.Database({
    filename: 'test.db'
}).connect(function(error) {
    if (error) {
        return console.log("CONNECTION ERROR: " + error);
    }

    this.query().select('*').from('users').execute(function(error, rows) {
        if (error) {
            return console.log('ERROR: ' + error);
        }
        console.log(rows.length + ' ROWS');
    });
});
```

