# Quartz
A module to interface with Transmission's RPC

# How to install
`npm install quartz`

# Functions

## quartz.connect(options, callback)
    var quartz = require('quartz');

    quartz.connect({
      url: "http://localhost:9091/transmission/rpc"
      , auth_required: false
      , username: "admin"
